### 完整参数
GET https://stagnant-illusion.rbq.dev/api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
    "pos-x": 0,
    "pos-y": 0,
    "scale": 1,
    "opacity": 0.8,
    "brightness": 100,
    "yellow": false,
    "yellowOpacity": 1
}

### 完整参数 - 黄色源石叠加
GET https://stagnant-illusion.rbq.dev/api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
  "pos-x": 0,
  "pos-y": 0,
  "scale": 1,
  "opacity": 0.8,
  "brightness": 100,
  "yellow": true,
  "yellowOpacity": 1
}

### 最小化参数
GET https://stagnant-illusion.rbq.dev/api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
}

### 最小化参数 - 黄色源石叠加
GET https://stagnant-illusion.rbq.dev/api
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
  "yellow": true
}
